  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 9 December 2026 at 12:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSurrounded by beautiful greenery and colourful flowers, 52 Kate Sheppard Avenue offers a lovely sense of peace and privacy, creating a welcoming place to call home. Set in a quiet, family-friendly neighbourhood, this spacious home combines a relaxed natural setting with the convenience of everyday amenities close by.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 689m2 section with approximately 220m2 of floor area, this two-storey home offers a practical and versatile layout, with plenty of space for families, guests and extended family living. The new kitchen brings a fresh feel to the heart of the home, making family meals and entertaining a pleasure. With four bedrooms, three bathrooms and two separate living areas, there's plenty of room for everyone to spread out without getting in each other's way.\r\n\r\nA home that gives your family more options:\r\n\r\n• Four good-sized bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n•Three separate living areas for family time, entertaining or relaxing\r\n• New kitchen, ready for you to enjoy\r\n• Downstairs bedroom with its own bathroom and separate external access – ideal for extended family, guests or teenagers wanting more independence\r\n• Upstairs study or retreat area, perfect for a home office, kids' playroom or quiet reading space\r\n• Central air conditioning and double glazing for year-round comfort\r\n• Handy attic storage for those extra household belongings\r\n• Reclad exterior for an updated look\r\n\r\nA Children's Paradise! There's plenty of outdoor space for children to run around, play with friends and enjoy the\r\nfreedom of being outdoors. It's the kind of backyard where childhood memories are made, while parents can relax knowing there's room for everyone. Location Matters Enjoy the peace of a welcoming community while staying close to everyday conveniences.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the school zones for Glamorgan Primary School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College. Whether you have a growing family, need extra space for grandparents or simply want a home that offers more flexibility, this property ticks many of the right boxes.\r\n\r\nPractical, spacious and family-friendly – a home where everyone has room to grow. Come and see it for yourself!",
